WEBVTT

30:01.291 --> 30:03.333
Buzz, the monkeys
aren't working!

30:03.418 --> 30:07.379
We're formulating another plan!
Stay calm!

30:07.464 --> 30:09.423
Oh, where could he be?

30:21.102 --> 30:24.271
-Can I help pump the gas?
-Sure! I'll even let you drive.

30:24.355 --> 30:26.356
-Yeah?
-Yeah, when you're 1 6.

30:27.108 --> 30:28.358
Funny, Mom.

30:28.443 --> 30:32.863
Great. How am I gonna convince
those guys it was an accident?
